AGENT LOG -- cross-agent synopsis of work sessions
==================================================
Append new entries at the bottom. One entry per working session that changes
project files. Keep it to a synopsis; detail lives in the files and git history.

Entry format:

  ## YYYY-MM-DD | <family> (<model>) | <one-line summary>
  - Did: what changed and why (a few bullets)
  - Files: files created / modified / deleted
  - Open: threads, caveats, or next steps for the next agent
  - Commit: hash if committed, else "uncommitted"

